---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Disclaimer | SarkariPhotoResizer.com" description="Official disclaimer for SarkariPhotoResizer.com — Independent educational tool notice.">
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 py-12 space-y-8">
    <div class="text-center space-y-2">
      <span class="text-xs font-black text-blue-600 uppercase tracking-wider">Transparency &amp; Governance</span>
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-black text-slate-900 tracking-tight">Legal Disclaimer</h1>
      <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-500">Notice to All Visitors and Candidates</p>
    </div>

    <div class="bg-white rounded-3xl p-6 sm:p-10 shadow-sm border border-slate-200/80 prose prose-slate max-w-none text-xs sm:text-sm leading-relaxed space-y-6">
      <div class="p-4 bg-amber-50 border border-amber-200 rounded-2xl text-amber-900 not-prose text-xs leading-relaxed space-y-2">
        <h3 class="font-bold text-sm text-amber-950 flex items-center gap-2">
          <span>⚠️</span> Important Notice: Independent Utility Platform
        </h3>
        <p>
          <strong>SarkariPhotoResizer.com is NOT an official government website and has NO official affiliation, endorsement, sponsorship, or association with any Government Ministry, Directorate, Recruitment Board, or Public Commission in India.</strong>
        </p>
      </div>

      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-base sm:text-lg font-bold text-slate-900">1. Non-Government Entity Clarification</h2>
        <p class="text-slate-600">
          The word "Sarkari" is used in this domain strictly as a commonly recognized descriptive term indicating that our utility presets are calibrated for Indian government and competitive examination application forms. We do not provide government recruitment, ticket sales, government registrations, or official application submissions.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-3 border-t border-slate-100 pt-6">
        <h2 class="text-base sm:text-lg font-bold text-slate-900">2. Verification Mandate</h2>
        <p class="text-slate-600">
          While we make every effort to maintain 100% precision regarding official photo, signature, and certificate size specifications (such as 20KB-50KB limits, 350x450 pixel ratios, and Name/DOP guidelines), applicants must always consult the original, official employment notification (e.g. published on ssc.gov.in, upsc.gov.in, or rrbcdg.gov.in) before finalizing and submitting their official candidature.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-3 border-t border-slate-100 pt-6">
        <h2 class="text-base sm:text-lg font-bold text-slate-900">3. Limitation of Liability</h2>
        <p class="text-slate-600">
          Under no circumstances shall the developers, authors, or administrators of SarkariPhotoResizer.com be held liable for any direct, indirect, incidental, or consequential loss resulting from form rejections, technical failures, or misinterpretation of examination criteria. Users are solely responsible for verifying their final uploaded documents.
        </p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
